SCP-#### - The emerald collection

Object class:

Safe

Containment proceedure:

The emerald collection must be kept in a really tight case made of titanium, with keypads that only 04 level+ clearance can unlock. This must be done so that no one can break in, and steal the emeralds

Description:

SCP-####-1,2,3,4,5,6,7 is a collection of 7 emeralds, rougly 4cm in diameter each, each emerald coming from a different continent on this planet. Whenever SCP-#### is touched, the person who interacted

with an emerald will recieve what that emerald gives, but to an extent that the person dies. For example, SCP-####-3 (Not yet in facilites) is the Wealth Emerald - whenever

someone touches this emerald, they will recieve money in the form of gold coins, but they will recieve too much of it that they die of suffication, and so does anyone who is

nearby and gets caught in the heap of gold coins. SCP-####-1 (Chaos emerald) and SCP-####-2 (Power emerald) have been found by the SCP foundation, but have been stolen by an

04 level clearance worker. SCP-####-3 (Wealth emerald), SCP-####-4 (Nature emerald) and SCP-####-5 (Aftermath emerald) have been found and the Foundation is trying their best

to get these emeralds before the 04 level clearance person (SCP-####-2) recieves them all, in which case an XK class end-of-the-world scenario would happen. SCP-####-6 and

SCP-####-7 have not been yet found, but their whereabouts are clear to the Foundation. The latest incident that the Foundation believes to be related with SCP-#### is a

massive crater (5km in diameter) that formed in the middle of a barren desert in Australia, on 23/11/19 at 18:23. This event has been covered by the SCP foundation, and

anybody who saw it, had this memory removed. It is said that SCP-####-1 (The Golden Gaunlet) has the power to control these, and can cause mass destruction if all seven

emeralds are placed within it. However, SCP-####-1 has been stolen along with SCP-####-1 and SCP-####-2.

Factfile:

SCP-####-1 (Found, but stolen - See SCP-#### for more details) is the Chaos emerald, which when touched, will cause chaos to sprout in the victim's body (organs explode, etc.).

Emerald was found in South America, Bolivia, near Potosi.

SCP-####-2 (Found, but stolen - See SCP-#### for more details) is the Power emerald, which when touched, will give the victim power, but too much so that they are ripped apart

by pure force, and any structures near them, will break apart. Emerald was found in Asia, Bhutan, near Bitana.

SCP-####-3 (Location found, but not retrieved) is the Wealth emerald, which when touched, will gives the victim wealth in the form of gold coins, but will recieve too much,

resulting in them being buried within the coins, along with any surrounding objects / living creatures, and being suffocated to death. Emerald is believed to be in North

America, USA, Michigan.

SCP-####-4 (Location found, but not retrieved) is the Nature emerald, which when touched, will cause trees to sprout around the victim. The branches from the trees, however,

will grow in size and strangle the victim to death. Emerald is believed to be in Europe, United Kingdom, Scotland.

SCP-####-5 (Location found, but not retrieved) is the Aftermath emerald, which when touched, will cause an aftermath of a large historic event to appear around the victim

(Radiation from a nuclear explosion, crater from a meteor impact) and will most likely cause the victim to die, and anyone surrounding them. Emerald is

believed to be in Oceania, Australia, New South Wales.

SCP-####-6 (Not found, yet whereabouts are clear) Emerald is believed to be in Africa.

SCP-####-7 (Not found, yet whereabouts are clear) Emerald is believed to be in Antarctica.





